    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How did you get here?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After befriending your first <strong>Ghost</strong> in the abandoned Arcade Hall, he asks you to retrieve any Ghosts that are trapped inside the Arcade Games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What do you do now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to retrieve the first 100 pieces, you must dive into the world of the Arcade Game Drama Llama and find every last fragment to free every soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you feel up to it, you can dive into 2 distinct Arcade Game experiences and retrieve the last 200 Ghosts trapped in them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888450/extras/f6be052b2f15a478d7ee38ad3cf349f9.poster.avif?t=1745766776\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888450/extras/f6be052b2f15a478d7ee38ad3cf349f9.webm?t=1745766776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888450/extras/f6be052b2f15a478d7ee38ad3cf349f9.mp4?t=1745766776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What then?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can compete against the whole world in global leaderboards by finding the 100 Ghosts exceedingly quicker!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And after that?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own levels or download user-created ones, including their own leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Level Editor DLC sold separately for 0.99$. I would like to keep the entire game free, but I sadly have to make back thhe 100$ Steam Fee and get funny stuff like tax advisers that keep me out of jail.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why would you do all that just to click Ghosts?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it is just so much fun! Seriously. It is also cozy and relaxing. But most of all, every pop you hear from finding a Ghost releases a bit more dopamine.<br><br><br>Thank you for reading this and have a great day! :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How did you get here?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After befriending your first <strong>Ghost</strong> in the abandoned Arcade Hall, he asks you to retrieve any Ghosts that are trapped inside the Arcade Games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What do you do now?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to retrieve the first 100 pieces, you must dive into the world of the Arcade Game Drama Llama and find every last fragment to free every soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you feel up to it, you can dive into 2 distinct Arcade Game experiences and retrieve the last 200 Ghosts trapped in them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888450/extras/f6be052b2f15a478d7ee38ad3cf349f9.poster.avif?t=1745766776\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888450/extras/f6be052b2f15a478d7ee38ad3cf349f9.webm?t=1745766776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888450/extras/f6be052b2f15a478d7ee38ad3cf349f9.mp4?t=1745766776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What then?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can compete against the whole world in global leaderboards by finding the 100 Ghosts exceedingly quicker!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And after that?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own levels or download user-created ones, including their own leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Level Editor DLC sold separately for 0.99$. I would like to keep the entire game free, but I sadly have to make back thhe 100$ Steam Fee and get funny stuff like tax advisers that keep me out of jail.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why would you do all that just to click Ghosts?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it is just so much fun! Seriously. It is also cozy and relaxing. But most of all, every pop you hear from finding a Ghost releases a bit more dopamine.<br><br><br>Thank you for reading this and have a great day! :)</p>",
    "short_description": "Find and free the hidden Ghosts spread throughout distinct Arcade Game Worlds, and create your own ones!",
